      "problem": "Minus signs are inconsistent. Screens 1, 2, 3 (title) and 8 use the true minus sign \"−\", but the math fields on screen 3 and the options on screen 4 use a hyphen (\"-3 + 3 = 0\", \"-11 °C\", \"-4 °C\").",
